---
title: "Snake run lifecycle, AI requests never halt"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Running
    lg1: Halted
    lg2: Idle
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 orange
  class lg2 tan
  s0: Menu
  s1: Playing
  s2: Playing, AI request in flight
  s3: Paused
  s4: Game over
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you start a run
  s0 --> s2: you hand the run to the AI
  s1 --> s3: you pause
  s2 --> s3: you pause
  s2 --> s1: the AI request fails or the AI answer arrives
  s3 --> s1: you resume
  s3 --> s2: you resume
  s1 --> s2: the AI request starts
  s1 --> s4: the run ends
  s2 --> s4: the run ends
  s4 --> s1: you run it again
  s4 --> s2: you let the AI run it again
  class s0 tan
  class s1 blue
  class s2 blue
  class s3 orange
  class s4 tan
